            "review_title": "Review at My House Seafood Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Lukas Nguyen\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam218 contributions\n1\nreasonable price for good quality food\nJul 2016 • Family\nThe owner of this restaurant is a nice guy, and can actually prepare some very nice dishes. Every time I come here, I would ask him to prepare something first base on the available ingredients of the day, and I have never been disappointed. Been coming here since 3 years ago and it is one of the best place for local seafood! Just be warned that it is getting popular with tourist now so the food quality can be vary a little bit.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 2, 2016",
